classDiagram
    class CaseContext {
        -Array cases
        -Object activeCase
        -Set watchlist
        -Boolean isTracing
        +createCase(title)
        +setTarget(txid)
        +dispatch(action)
        +exportAuditReport()
    }
    class BitcoinApiGateway {
        -String primaryEndpoint
        -String fallbackEndpoint
        -Map lruCache
        -String circuitBreakerState
        +fetchTx(txid)
        +fetchOutspends(txid)
        +fetchAddressMeta(addr)
        +tripFailover()
    }
    class TraceHeuristicsEngine {
        -Object weights
        -Float threshold
        -Float depthDecay
        -Integer dustLimit
        +scoreOutput(params)
        +isRoundValue(sats)
        +evaluateBIP69(vout)
        +computeConfidence()
    }
    class TaintAnalysisEngine {
        -String activeModel
        -Map taintLedger
        -Float seedVolume
        -Float conservationTolerance
        +computeHaircut(tx)
        +computeFIFO(tx)
        +computePoison(tx)
        +auditValueConservation()
    }
    class ClusteringEngine {
        -Object dsu
        -Map clusterMap
        -Set mixPools
        -Float entropyThreshold
        +clusterAddresses(vins)
        +calculateShannonEntropy()
        +detectPeelSequence()
        +findRoot(addr)
    }
    class ChainOfCustodyLedger {
        -Array eventChain
        -String genesisHash
        -String currentDigest
        -String officerSignature
        +appendBlock(event)
        +verifyLedgerIntegrity()
        +exportSection67Notice()
        +signSection65BCertificate()
    }

    CaseContext --> BitcoinApiGateway : queries
    CaseContext --> TaintAnalysisEngine : updates
    CaseContext --> ChainOfCustodyLedger : records
    BitcoinApiGateway --> TraceHeuristicsEngine : provides data
    BitcoinApiGateway --> ClusteringEngine : provides vins
    TraceHeuristicsEngine ..> TaintAnalysisEngine : informs
    TaintAnalysisEngine ..> ChainOfCustodyLedger : signs
